{"synopsis":"Diadaptasi dari salah satu novel top sepanjang masa\nKetika orang tuanya meninggal dia mendapatkan warisan sebesar 500 juta yen\nSejak saat itu dia memutuskan untuk melakukan apapun yang dia suka Anak lakilaki itu memasuki game online paling menantang Dungeon Attack di mana dia menjadi orang pertama yang membuka pencapaian Mengalahkan semua Raja Iblis Namun ketika dia menjawab pertanyaan misterius yang muncul setelah menyelesaikan permainan dia tibatiba terlempar ke dunia permainan\nDia telah bereinkarnasi sebagai Dantalian Raja Iblis Terendah dan Terlemah Peringkat 71 di dunia game Dengan hanya ingatannya saat mengalahkan Raja Iblis terkuat dan kefasihannya yang dapat diandalkan dia berjuang untuk bertahan hidup di Dunia Brutal ini\nIni adalah Kisah Balas Dendam dan Bangkit Kembali","alternative_title":"ダンジョンディフェンス","author":"Arrone","artist":"","chapters":[{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"88b7c68f-bade-4b82-8ccc-973330e50c92","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"810f8c92-f7f6-4ce0-93ab-990b7b9ea8a0","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"8521fd50-a024-4b1c-8232-d5d05a3f17bd","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"321961c8-06e0-47b1-af3b-3671b9179fe4","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"36cbfb4a-e440-4a99-adf7-d28d9b02266e","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"c0af475f-fbe7-473e-871a-ec09000b0671","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"80407b14-814b-4661-b512-5fbc5960adce","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"b766e4e4-561f-4a4a-b7d4-5b7189ab7879","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"92ddf60c-2d25-4d85-a6d4-8953ee17f4cb","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2024-12-03"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"56c21d6b-75da-4f